+## Subtopics
+
+### Narrow-band Fourier Transform
+An approximate, fast method for computing the mesh FT limited to a specific frequency range. Used in shape optimization to reduce computational cost. [Link to FT methods if available, otherwise self-contained].
+
+### Exact Fourier Transform
+A slower, full-spectrum method for computing the mesh FT. Used in PSF optimization to avoid bias from the narrow-band threshold.
+
+### Multimaterial Mesh Representation
+A nonmanifold mesh representation used to model complex biological structures like cell clusters. Supports topological changes and remeshing.
 
